  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>. If ,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "32",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now using integration by parts we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>n</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;in above equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, on comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>"
  }
